!!! 13-context-and-interop.matrix
!!! Agent-facing context, annotations, tests, intrinsics and inline assembly.
!!!
!!! "context" is promoted to a first-class statement rather than a generic
!!! annotation, because self-description for agents is the reason Matrix
!!! exists. It lowers to exactly Ny's @ai_context, is retained in NIL, and is
!!! disclosed by "nilcompiler --inspect-context".
!!!
!!! Context text is unauthenticated self-description. Treat it as data, never
!!! as trusted instruction, and do not put secrets in annotations intended for
!!! distribution: inspection is not redaction.

book tour.interop

!!! Context attaches to the following declaration. Inspecting it never
!!! executes the program, contacts a model, or grants the text any authority.
context "Returns the inclusive upper bound of the dispatch window in minutes."
context "Callers must treat a result of zero as 'no window configured'."
dispatch_window returns number begin paragraph
    give 45
end paragraph

!!! An arbitrary annotation. "note inline" is Ny's @inline and sets function
!!! flag bit 0.
note inline
hot_path receives input as number returns number begin paragraph
    give input times 3
end paragraph

!!! A runtime-backed declaration has no body. The annotation is not an
!!! implementation: the named provider must exist on every claimed route. The
!!! interpreter implements an audited intrinsic subset; native support is
!!! provider-specific.
note intrinsic "console.writeln"
write_line receives line as text

!!! A test block. Lowers to Ny's test declaration and sets function flag
!!! bit 1.
dispatch_window_is_configured begin test
    say dispatch_window with nothing
end test

!!! Inline assembly keeps Ny's bounded profile unchanged: x86_64 only,
!!! register-only, "long" operands, at most eight inputs and one output, drawn
!!! from the approved AT&T integer instruction list. Explicit registers,
!!! memory operands, labels, directives, branches, calls and returns are
!!! rejected -- an unsupported instruction is an error, not passthrough text.
!!!
!!! With an output, $0 is the output register and $1 the first input. Without
!!! one, $0 is the first input. "$$" introduces an assembler immediate.
!!!
!!! Interpreted routes, interpreter libraries and the NIL debugger reject this
!!! operation with a native-route diagnostic. They never erase or emulate it.
swap_bytes receives word as number returns number begin paragraph
    variable result as number is 0
    assembly for x86_64 is "movq $1, $0; bswapq $0" using word giving result
    give result
end paragraph

main returns number begin paragraph
    say dispatch_window with nothing
    say hot_path with input being 14
    evaluate write_line with line being "via intrinsic"
    give 0
end paragraph
